# This repo is edited on Windows and deployed to Linux.
#
# Anything the server executes must arrive with LF endings. A shell script
# checked out with CRLF fails as `bash: $'\r': command not found`, and a
# systemd unit with CRLF fails to parse - both at deploy time, on a machine
# you are SSH'd into, which is the worst place to debug a line ending.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.service       text eol=lf
*.py            text eol=lf

# Normalise the rest, but leave the working tree to the platform.
*.md            text
*.txt           text
*.json          text
*.example       text
